the log.
P5 — cross-host replication split. Structural facts replicate on the rented host: ~388 launches/pass, same
kernel identities, GPU-busy ≈ 1.26 ms ± clock/vCPU variation. Host-dependent facts do not: wall time and idle
fraction move; predicted direction — cloud vCPU dispatches slower than office CPU ⇒ idle fraction holds or
RISES above 77–83%.
P6 — (eval-week, registered now) L2 sweep: the traffic-deletion share of the grouped kernel's win grows as
